[{"answer":"Good afternoon and welcome to Habitat Hunters.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-listening-17-2019-03-28-13-37-23/1.mp3"},{"answer":"You must be Joseph?","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-listening-17-2019-03-28-13-37-23/2.mp3"},{"answer":"Yes, that's right. You said on the phone that I could come by at 2 o'clock.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-listening-17-2019-03-28-13-37-23/3.mp3"},{"answer":"Sorry, I'm a little early.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-listening-17-2019-03-28-13-37-23/4.mp3"},{"answer":"No, no problem at all.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-listening-17-2019-03-28-13-37-23/5.mp3"},{"answer":"In Calgary's market, you have to move fast if you want a good apartment!","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-listening-17-2019-03-28-13-37-23/6.mp3"},{"answer":"Actually, I'd settle for almost anything.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-listening-17-2019-03-28-13-37-23/7.mp3"},{"answer":"I've been here ten days and the hotel is ruining me.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-listening-17-2019-03-28-13-37-23/8.mp3"},{"answer":"My father has me on a strict budget.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-listening-17-2019-03-28-13-37-23/9.mp3"},{"answer":"Sit right down here now, sir.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-listening-17-2019-03-28-13-37-23/10.mp3"},{"answer":"Let's talk a little about the places before we go have a look.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-listening-17-2019-03-28-13-37-23/11.mp3"},{"answer":"Now, we have 4 apartments available.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-listening-17-2019-03-28-13-37-23/12.mp3"},{"answer":"OK, could you tell me more about those 4 apartments?","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-listening-17-2019-03-28-13-37-23/13.mp3"},{"answer":"Sure. The first one is on Beatle Road, just a block off campus.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-listening-17-2019-03-28-13-37-23/14.mp3"},{"answer":"It's a 3-bedroom with a bathroom and a living room and a great Italian restaurant right next to it.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-listening-17-2019-03-28-13-37-23/15.mp3"},{"answer":"How much?","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-listening-17-2019-03-28-13-37-23/16.mp3"},{"answer":"Well, it's $435 a month, including Internet and utilities.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-listening-17-2019-03-28-13-37-23/17.mp3"},{"answer":"Okay, that sounds reasonable.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-listening-17-2019-03-28-13-37-23/18.mp3"},{"answer":"Any drawbacks to the house?","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-listening-17-2019-03-28-13-37-23/19.mp3"},{"answer":"There's a really big garden, but it hasn't been taken care of over the years and","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-listening-17-2019-03-28-13-37-23/20.mp3"},{"answer":"is just too big to clean up nicely.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-listening-17-2019-03-28-13-37-23/21.mp3"},{"answer":"Hmm. That sounds okay.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-listening-17-2019-03-28-13-37-23/22.mp3"},{"answer":"Tell me about the next option.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-listening-17-2019-03-28-13-37-23/23.mp3"},{"answer":"The other 3-bedroom apartment is on Oakington Avenue on campus.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-listening-17-2019-03-28-13-37-23/24.mp3"},{"answer":"It is right near the building where you have classes,","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-listening-17-2019-03-28-13-37-23/25.mp3"},{"answer":"and the kitchen and living room are newly furnished.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-listening-17-2019-03-28-13-37-23/26.mp3"},{"answer":"Wow, that sounds like a pretty good option.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-listening-17-2019-03-28-13-37-23/27.mp3"},{"answer":"Well, it is a cool apartment,","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-listening-17-2019-03-28-13-37-23/28.mp3"},{"answer":"but since it's a dormitory, the living room, bathroom, kitchen, and washing machine are all shared.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-listening-17-2019-03-28-13-37-23/29.mp3"},{"answer":"It would be nice not to have to buy living room furniture, though.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-listening-17-2019-03-28-13-37-23/30.mp3"},{"answer":"And how much is this one?","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-listening-17-2019-03-28-13-37-23/31.mp3"},{"answer":"$400 per month for a bedroom with an air conditioner.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-listening-17-2019-03-28-13-37-23/32.mp3"},{"answer":"For a bedroom without an air conditioner, you would pay less,","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-listening-17-2019-03-28-13-37-23/33.mp3"},{"answer":"$340 for it.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-listening-17-2019-03-28-13-37-23/34.mp3"},{"answer":"Yikes, even with the air conditioner, it sounds really inconvenient to have to share facilities.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-listening-17-2019-03-28-13-37-23/35.mp3"},{"answer":"I'll never cook if I have to walk down the hall to use the kitchen.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-listening-17-2019-03-28-13-37-23/36.mp3"},{"answer":"Yeah, that's true.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-listening-17-2019-03-28-13-37-23/37.mp3"},{"answer":"Anyway, the next place is a 2-bedroom on Mead Street.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-listening-17-2019-03-28-13-37-23/38.mp3"},{"answer":"Oh, I like Mead Street - that's off campus, right?","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-listening-17-2019-03-28-13-37-23/39.mp3"},{"answer":"Yep. It's pretty cool, but it only has 2 bedrooms, plus a living room and a study.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-listening-17-2019-03-28-13-37-23/40.mp3"},{"answer":"But I want to live together with my 2 friends.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-listening-17-2019-03-28-13-37-23/41.mp3"},{"answer":"So you could make the study into a small bedroom if you end up living with them.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-listening-17-2019-03-28-13-37-23/42.mp3"},{"answer":"Also, we guys want a TV and DVD player since we're all so much into movies.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-listening-17-2019-03-28-13-37-23/43.mp3"},{"answer":"Well, this place has a great TV and VCR, but no DVD player.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-listening-17-2019-03-28-13-37-23/44.mp3"},{"answer":"No DVD? That's so weird.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-listening-17-2019-03-28-13-37-23/45.mp3"},{"answer":"Are any other facilities provided?","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-listening-17-2019-03-28-13-37-23/46.mp3"},{"answer":"As you said, weird enough, it also comes with a washbasin.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-listening-17-2019-03-28-13-37-23/47.mp3"},{"answer":"Is there a washing machine?","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-listening-17-2019-03-28-13-37-23/48.mp3"},{"answer":"I think we need that more than just a washbasin.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-listening-17-2019-03-28-13-37-23/49.mp3"},{"answer":"I'm afraid there's no washing machine in the apartment.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-listening-17-2019-03-28-13-37-23/50.mp3"},{"answer":"Wow, that's so old-fashioned!","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-listening-17-2019-03-28-13-37-23/51.mp3"},{"answer":"Maybe it's not the best choice for 3 college guys.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-listening-17-2019-03-28-13-37-23/52.mp3"},{"answer":"How much is it?","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-listening-17-2019-03-28-13-37-23/53.mp3"},{"answer":"Well, it's $600 per month,","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-listening-17-2019-03-28-13-37-23/54.mp3"},{"answer":"but of course it would be cheaper if you made it into 3 bedrooms instead of 2.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-listening-17-2019-03-28-13-37-23/55.mp3"},{"answer":"Where is the apartment located?","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-listening-17-2019-03-28-13-37-23/56.mp3"},{"answer":"It's 2500 Mead Street, where there are a lot of bars.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-listening-17-2019-03-28-13-37-23/57.mp3"},{"answer":"It would be affordable, but it would get pretty noisy.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-listening-17-2019-03-28-13-37-23/58.mp3"},{"answer":"And that sounds really expensive for an old place in a noisy area.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-listening-17-2019-03-28-13-37-23/59.mp3"},{"answer":"How about the last place?","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-listening-17-2019-03-28-13-37-23/60.mp3"},{"answer":"This one's on-campus in the Devon Close complex.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-listening-17-2019-03-28-13-37-23/61.mp3"},{"answer":"It's a one-bedroom so it will be a little quieter than the Mead Street place.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-listening-17-2019-03-28-13-37-23/62.mp3"},{"answer":"One bedroom huh? That could be good for focusing on my studies.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-listening-17-2019-03-28-13-37-23/63.mp3"},{"answer":"What else does it have?","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-listening-17-2019-03-28-13-37-23/64.mp3"},{"answer":"It comes with a living room and a study,","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-listening-17-2019-03-28-13-37-23/65.mp3"},{"answer":"and includes a really nice lamp in the study that has a bunch of different settings.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-listening-17-2019-03-28-13-37-23/66.mp3"},{"answer":"You know what else is cool?","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-listening-17-2019-03-28-13-37-23/67.mp3"},{"answer":"There's a dining hall downstairs so all evening meals are free.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-listening-17-2019-03-28-13-37-23/68.mp3"},{"answer":"You can purchase breakfast and lunch, but meals after 6 p.m. are free.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-listening-17-2019-03-28-13-37-23/69.mp3"},{"answer":"Wow, this place sounds too good to be true.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-listening-17-2019-03-28-13-37-23/70.mp3"},{"answer":"Is it really expensive?","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-listening-17-2019-03-28-13-37-23/71.mp3"},{"answer":"It's alright - $500 per month, but there's no bathroom.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-listening-17-2019-03-28-13-37-23/72.mp3"},{"answer":"What? No bathroom?","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-listening-17-2019-03-28-13-37-23/73.mp3"},{"answer":"Well, there's no bathroom in the apartment, but there's one at the end of the hall.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-listening-17-2019-03-28-13-37-23/74.mp3"},{"answer":"Hmm. Thanks, I think now I just have to decide whether I want to live alone or not.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-listening-17-2019-03-28-13-37-23/75.mp3"},{"answer":"Yeah, which one do you prefer?","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-listening-17-2019-03-28-13-37-23/76.mp3"},{"answer":"I think I'd choose either this apartment or the one on Beatle Road.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-listening-17-2019-03-28-13-37-23/77.mp3"},{"answer":"OK. You'd better think about it, and then you can contact me ASAP","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-listening-17-2019-03-28-13-37-23/78.mp3"},{"answer":"Fine, thanks for your help!","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-listening-17-2019-03-28-13-37-23/79.mp3"}]
